2DA V1.0
*
# ethren (M3.3): the gods a cleric may serve, by alignment (docs/rules/classes.md, "Gods"). A cleric's god
# must share its alignment: the level-1 class pick offers the gods of the character's alignment, and an
# alignment change at level 0 drops a god of another one. ID is the CRE extension's CHAR god (IE_DCC_GOD);
# ALIGN L, N or C; NAME with _ for spaces. The game's own pantheon replaces this list when it is written.
             ID  ALIGN  NAME
SHUL         1   L      Shul
KLAZATH      2   L      Klazath
ULESH        3   L      Ulesh
CHORANUS     4   L      Choranus
DAENTHAR     5   L      Daenthar
GORHAN       6   L      Gorhan
JUSTICIA     7   L      Justicia
ARISTEMIS    8   L      Aristemis
AMUN_TOR     9   N      Amun_Tor
ILDAVIR      10  N      Ildavir
PELAGIA      11  N      Pelagia
CTHULHU      12  N      Cthulhu
AHRIMAN      13  C      Ahriman
HIDDEN_LORD  14  C      The_Hidden_Lord
AZI_DAHAKA   15  C      Azi_Dahaka
BOBUGBUBILZ  16  C      Bobugbubilz
CADIXTAT     17  C      Cadixtat
NIMLURUN     18  C      Nimlurun
MALOTOCH     19  C      Malotoch
